Error: Jet.InvalidServiceEnable: The service `ssh` has no `enable`
  --> config.jet:1:39
    |
  1 | m: module { env.dev: Env{ services: { ssh: { ports: [22] } } } }
    |                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: U12: every `Service` says whether it is on with a required `enable` flag, then any further settings
 Fix: Add `enable: true` (or `false`) to `ssh`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.InvalidServiceEnable
